“AN ORDINANCE VACATING THE ALLEY IN BLOCK ONE AND THE ALLEY IN
BLOCK 2 OF OSTDIEK SUBDIVISION, CHEYENNE, WYOMING (LOCATED EAST OF
WILLS ROAD, BETWEEN CHARLES AND CHEYENNE STREETS).”  Larry Perry,
Terrestrial Surveying and Mapping, agent for the property owner, provided information
concerning the vacation request.  Reporting for Public Services Committee, Mr. Collins moved
to approve on third and final reading, seconded by Ms. Broyles.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” –
